  "description": "Operating Area: Summer Season: Mediterranean - French Riviera, Monaco in July, Corsica, Sardinia in August 2026\nWinter Season: Caribbeans St Barth, St Martin\n\nStep aboard the Riva 82' Diva, a masterpiece of Italian craftsmanship that redefines luxury on the water.\n\nThis elegant yacht combines cutting-edge technology, contemporary design, and unmatched performance to offer an extraordinary charter experience.\n\nKEY FEATURES\n• Expansive beach club with a hydraulic swim platform  \n• Luxurious flybridge with ample sunbathing & lounge areas  \n• Alfresco dining on both the main deck & flybridge \n• 4 stylish cabins accommodating up to 8 guests  \n• State-of-the-art stabilizers for enhanced comfort  \n• Sleek, modern interior designed for ultimate relaxation",
